+# combo_spec: D9/3+D15/1
+# Name: 图例参与匹配+单一图例颜色
+#
+# Design analysis
+# ===============
+# fusion_rule:
+#   - Baseline d59b0160 reads a color set from the top-left legend, then deletes every external
+#     4-connected multicolor component whose color-set contains all legend colors.
